From 09bd044b3ae18624fac42bb87866c5925d395a35 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@local>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:18:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/29] turnip: add isolated a5xx compute MVP path

Do not wire a5xx into the A6XX+ template machinery: program the a5xx
compute state with CP_LOAD_STATE4, HLSQ_CS_* and a shader object, upload
SSBO state from a compact per-binding descriptor, and dispatch with
CP_EXEC_CS. Lower Vulkan descriptor intrinsics to bindful SSBO slots for
gen5 and restrict the exposed features to the compute MVP.

